# A Gym Leader of Johto (HeartGold's Leader battle theme): brass hits and a proud trumpet line in G minor over
# timpani and driving strings. Original composition for this game (plan 20 · J4).
title Battle! Gym Leader (Johto)
tempo 158
meter 4/4
lowhptempo 1.07
reverb 0.18

track lead trumpet lowhp=sawlead vol=0.8 pan=0.05 rev=0.2
  o5 g8 r8 g8 r8 f8 r8 f8 r8 | o5 e-8 r8 e-8 r8 d4 d4 | L o5 g4. a8 b-4 o6 d4 | o6 c4 o5 b-8 a8 g2 |
  o5 e-4. f8 g4 b-4 | o5 a4 f+8 e8 d2 | o5 g4. a8 b-4 o6 c4 | o6 d4 c8 o5 b-8 a4 f+4 |
  o5 g4 b-4 a4 f+4 | o5 g2 d2 |

track brass brass unless=lowhp vol=0.36 pan=-0.25 rev=0.22
  o4 (g b- d)8 r8 (g b- d)8 r8 (f a c)8 r8 (f a c)8 r8 | (e- g b-)8 r8 (e- g b-)8 r8 (d f+ a)4 (d f+ a)4 | L o4 (g b- d)1 | (e- g b-)1 |
  (e- g b-)1 | (d f+ a)1 | (g b- d)1 | (d f+ a)1 |
  (e- g b-)2 (d f+ a)2 | (g b- d)1 |

